  "title": "SunCoke Energy, Inc. Announces Haverhill Cokemaking Agreement",
  "summary": "LISLE, Ill.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- SunCoke Energy, Inc. (NYSE: SXC) and Cleveland-Cliffs Inc. have agreed to a 3-year extension of their cokemaking agreement, under which SunCoke will provide 500 thousand tons of metallurgical coke annually to Cleveland-Cliffs from its Haverhill cokemaking facility located in Franklin",
